{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-21", "prepared_on": "2026-11-21", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-21</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic starts trading on Wall Street<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 在華爾街正式掛牌交易</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic began trading on the Nasdaq under the ticker \"ANT\" at $111.50 per share, up from its $83 IPO price, valuing the company at around $1.5 trillion.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 以代號「ANT」在那斯達克開盤，開盤價 111.5 美元，高於 83 美元的發行價，公司市值約 1.5 兆美元。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1035384/anthropic-ipo-trading-nasdaq\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> AI claimed a solution to the 167-year-old Riemann hypothesis — and a human did, too<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 宣稱解開 167 年歷史的黎曼猜想，同時也有人類提出競爭解法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Mathematicians are stunned by the latest AI-driven result, and a competing human solution has also been put forward.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">數學家對這項 AI 驅動的最新成果感到震撼，同時也出現了一份人類提出的競爭解法。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/20/ai-claimed-a-solution-to-the-167-year-old-riemann-hypothesis-and-a-human-did-too/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> The fallout from Nvidia's Jensen Huang scandal continues<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">輝達黃仁勳醜聞的餘波持續擴大</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia reported healthy earnings while dealing with the ouster of CEO Jensen Huang, and said it will stop selling H200 chips in China.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">輝達在處理執行長黃仁勳去職風波的同時公布財報，成長穩健，並表示將停止在中國銷售 H200 晶片。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/podcast/the-fallout-from-nvidias-jensen-huang-scandal-continues/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Google gives Gemini the ability to use your Mac for you<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 讓 Gemini 能代替你操作 Mac</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's latest Gemini update brings an AI agent to the Mac that can organize files, fill out forms, and handle multistep workflows.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 最新更新在 Mac 上加入 AI 代理人，可整理檔案、填寫表單並完成多步驟工作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/google-gives-gemini-the-ability-to-use-your-mac-for-you/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Trump threatens 'tremendous tax' for moving AI data centers outside the US<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">川普威脅對把 AI 資料中心設在美國境外的公司課徵「巨額稅金」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">President Trump promised a \"tremendous tax\" on companies that build data centers abroad, even as US states and cities restrict new data center applications.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">川普承諾對在海外興建資料中心的企業課徵「巨額稅金」，而美國各州與城市同時正在限制新的資料中心申請案。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/policy/1038892/trump-foreign-data-centers-tax\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> The most misunderstood graph in AI just got a major update<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 領域最被誤解的圖表迎來重大更新</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A new METR report finds some AI capabilities still improve exponentially, but models are weaker at tasks requiring judgment than at coding.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">評測機構 METR 的新報告指出，部分 AI 能力仍呈指數成長，但模型在需要判斷力的任務上不如寫程式表現好。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/11/20/1149399/the-most-misunderstood-graph-in-ai-just-got-a-major-update/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Researcher plants 2m canaries into the AI supply chain. A privacy disaster surfaced.<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">研究人員在 AI 供應鏈植入 200 萬個「金絲雀」，揭露隱私災難</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A test using prompts with unique, trackable secrets shows that user data does not stay private as it moves through the AI supply chain.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究以含有獨特、可追蹤機密的提示詞進行測試，證明使用者資料在 AI 供應鏈中並不會保持私密。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/a-leaky-ai-supply-chain-is-exposing-secret-user-data-at-an-alarming-rate/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> VMware patches critical vCenter flaws; upgrading is the only mitigation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">VMware 發布資安更新修補重大等級 vCenter 漏洞，警告只能升級、無其他緩解方法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Broadcom fixed five flaws in vCenter, VMware Tools and SDDC Manager, including a critical authentication bypass (CVE-2026-123890) with no workaround other than patching.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">博通修補 vCenter、VMware Tools 與 SDDC Manager 的 5 個漏洞，其中重大等級的身分驗證繞過漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 除更新外沒有其他緩解措施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180673\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Signal is blocking Gemini and Siri AI from reading your screen<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Signal 阻擋 Gemini 與 Siri 的 AI 讀取你的螢幕</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Signal is restricting screenshots on Android and iOS to stop OS-level AI agents from reading users' messages and other on-screen data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Signal 在 Android 與 iOS 上限制截圖功能，避免作業系統內建的 AI 代理人讀取使用者訊息與螢幕資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1038390/signal-blocking-ai-agent-screenshots-mobile-app\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Combatting adversarial distillation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 對抗惡意蒸餾的做法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI describes a layered approach combining model training, safeguards, detection, and enforcement to protect against capability extraction.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 說明其多層防護做法，結合模型訓練、安全機制、偵測與執法，以防止模型能力被擷取。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/combatting-adversarial-distillation\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}